IconFlow — collision set
Originally authored by snowyukitty, 2026. All rights waived below.

SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0

These files are deliberately plain renditions of generic forms — a gear, a
bell, a folder, a bar chart, a plus sign — drawn so that a candidate icon can
be measured against them at 16px. They are nobody's icon set and claim
nothing. To the extent possible under law, the author has waived all copyright
and related or neighboring rights to them. The full CC0 1.0 Universal legal
code is in licenses/CC0-1.0.txt at the repository root and in the packaged
license files.
